  "title": "Finnish Runeberg Tortes",
  "description": "A Finnish tradition, these ginger- and rum-flavored, jam-filled mini cakes are eaten in the beginning of each year to celebrate the birth of the famous poet, Johan Runeberg.",
  "authors": [
    "Annleih"
  ],
